JSONEachPacketString: bounded samples and final progress
JSONEachPacketBase64: bounded samples and final progress
EventStream: bounded samples and final progress
default and explicit disable: no samples
query settings disable URL capture
query settings enable framing and samples
plain HTTP and query settings disable framing
buffering=0: samples precede terminal exception
buffering=1: samples precede terminal exception
query identifiers are sanitized to UTF-8
samples do not require access to system.trace_log
samples arrive while the query is running
